{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Balmer 谱"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Balmer谱"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>环的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":"称为 "},{"Local":{"url":"higherZar","text":"$2$-环"}},{"Plain":", 大致上是"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半"}},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":". 环的"},{"Local":{"url":"谱(代数)","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"在 $2$-环中有一类比, 称为 <strong>Balmer 谱</strong>, 其中的点是所谓厚张量理想 (thick tensor ideal), 厚的意思是关于 "},{"Local":{"url":"余纤维列","text":"(余) 纤维"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"收缩","text":"收缩"}},{"Plain":"封闭.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal K$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"higherZar","text":"$2$-环"}},{"Plain":", 即"},{"Local":{"url":"幂等完备范畴","text":"幂等完备"}},{"Plain":"小"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定"}},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半"}},{"Plain":"范畴. 考虑其中的根理想, 即满足 $x^{\\otimes 2}\\in\\mathcal J$ 蕴涵 $x\\in\\mathcal J$ 的厚张量理想 $\\mathcal J$, 构成的"},{"Local":{"url":"位象","text":"位象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Rad}(\\mathcal K)$.</p>\n"}]}}